          "sol": "Step 1: x = 0.666...\nStep 2: 10x = 6.666...\nStep 3: 10x − x = 6.\nStep 4: 9x = 6.\nStep 5: x = 6/9 = 2/3.",
          "hint": "Let x = 0.666... and multiply by 10.",
