          "why": "Triangle area is half the product of its base and perpendicular height.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A = 1/2 × 12 × 4.\nStep 2: 12 ÷ 2 = 6.\nStep 3: 6 × 4 = 24.",
          "hint": "Use A = 1/2 × b × h.",
          "subject": "math",
