          "why": "Ratios are simplified by dividing both terms by their highest common factor",
          "sol": "Step 1: Find HCF of 24 and 36\nStep 2: HCF = 12\nStep 3: Divide both terms by 12\nStep 4: 24 ÷ 12 and 36 ÷ 12\nStep 5: Write simplified ratio",
          "hint": "HCF method",
