          "sol": "Step 1: Group i components → 2i + 4i\nStep 2: Group j components → 3j + 5j\nStep 3: Add i components → 6i\nStep 4: Add j components → 8j\nStep 5: Combine results",
          "hint": "add like components",
          "subject": "math",
