          "why": "Constant multiples remain unchanged in integration",
          "sol": "Step 1: Keep constant 3 outside\nStep 2: Integrate x² → x³/3\nStep 3: Multiply → 3 × (x³/3)\nStep 4: Simplify expression\nStep 5: Add +C",
