          "sol": "Step 1: Integrate 2x → x²\nStep 2: Integrate 1 → x\nStep 3: Combine → x² + x\nStep 4: Apply limits [0, 1] → (1² + 1) - (0² + 0)\nStep 5: Result = 2 - 0 = 2",
